---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const googleReviewUrl = 'https://g.page/r/CYdfZCbKjtjsEBM/review';
---

<Layout
  title="Share Your Experience | Arkansas Property Buyers"
  description="Share your experience with Arkansas Property Buyers. Your honest feedback helps other Arkansas homeowners know what to expect when they reach out to our team."
  noindex={true}
>
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-gray-50 flex flex-col">
    <header class="bg-white border-b border-gray-100">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 h-16 flex items-center justify-between">
        <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <img src="/images/apb-icon.png" alt="Arkansas Property Buyers" class="h-10 w-auto object-contain">
          <span class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm tracking-tight">Arkansas Property Buyers</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/" class="font-sub font-bold text-xs text-grey hover:text-navy transition-colors uppercase tracking-wider">Back to Website</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="flex-1 flex items-center py-14 sm:py-20">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 w-full">
        <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] gap-10 lg:gap-14 items-center">
          <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 bg-white shadow-sm">
            <img
              src="/images/apbteam.png?v=3"
              alt="Arkansas Property Buyers team in Little Rock, Arkansas"
              class="w-full object-cover aspect-[4/3]"
            >
          </div>

          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow tracking-widest mb-3">Thank You for Trusting Us</p>
            <h1 class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase leading-tight text-4xl sm:text-5xl mb-4">Would You Share Your Experience?</h1>
            <p class="font-body text-grey text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6 max-w-xl">
              We’re grateful we had the opportunity to work with you. If you have a minute, an honest Google review helps other Arkansas homeowners know what to expect when they reach out to us.
            </p>

            <a
              id="google-review-button"
              href={googleReviewUrl}
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-orange hover:bg-gold text-white font-sub font-bold text-sm px-8 py-4 rounded-lg transition-all uppercase tracking-wider shadow-md hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-0.5 w-full sm:w-auto"
            >
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2a10 10 0 100 20 10 10 0 000-20zm3.37 14.23c-.92.87-2.15 1.37-3.37 1.37A5.6 5.6 0 116.4 12 5.6 5.6 0 0112 6.4c1.51 0 2.78.55 3.76 1.48l-1.53 1.53A3.34 3.34 0 0012 8.54 3.46 3.46 0 108.54 12 3.46 3.46 0 0012 15.46c1.73 0 2.91-.99 3.16-2.35H12v-2.06h5.34c.06.3.1.64.1 1.05 0 1.63-.55 3.08-2.07 4.13z"/></svg>
              Leave a Google Review
            </a>

            <p class="font-body text-grey text-xs mt-3">Any honest feedback is appreciated — there’s no need to write anything long.</p>

            <div class="mt-9 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
              <h2 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Not sure what to say?</h2>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">You can simply share whatever stood out about your experience. A few things you might think about:</p>
              <ul class="space-y-3 font-body text-grey text-sm">
                <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-orange font-bold">•</span><span>Was the process easy to understand?</span></li>
                <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-orange font-bold">•</span><span>Did our team communicate clearly and do what we said we would do?</span></li>
                <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-orange font-bold">•</span><span>Did selling as-is make your situation easier?</span></li>
                <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-orange font-bold">•</span><span>Would you recommend Arkansas Property Buyers to someone in a similar situation?</span></li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-8 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-5">
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Have feedback you’d rather share directly with our team? We want to hear that too. <a href="/contact-us" class="font-sub font-bold text-orange hover:text-gold transition-colors">Send us a message.</a>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>

    <footer class="bg-white border-t border-gray-100 py-6">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 text-center">
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-xs">Arkansas Property Buyers · Based in Little Rock, Arkansas · (501) 504-7109</p>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script is:inline>
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {
      var button = document.getElementById('google-review-button');
      if (button) {
        button.addEventListener('click', function () {
          if (window.gtag) {
            gtag('event', 'google_review_click', {
              page_path: window.location.pathname,
              destination: 'google_review_form'
            });
          }
        });
      }
    });
  </script>
</Layout>
